t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度整合升级文心网站并加持文心5.1模型，新增Office在线编辑功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合博通发布首款自研AI推理芯片Jalapeño，计划2026年底部署</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">GitHub Copilot于6月正式启用量化计费模式，单月使用量创历史新高</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini 3.5 Flash模型，新增计算机操作能力实现自主办公</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月25日，谷歌正式发布Gemini 3.5 Flash模型，核心升级在于深度优化“计算机操作（computer use）”能力，使AI能直接接管电脑界面并自主完成跨软件工作流。该模型在编码及自主代理任务表现上已超越3.1 Pro版本，并显著提升了响应速度。Gemini 3.5 Flash现已覆盖谷歌生态，包括Gemini应用、搜索AI模式，开发者可通过Gemini API或企业版工具调用，同时该模型将驱动新一代个人AI代理Gemini Spark。针对自主操作带来的安全挑战，谷歌强化了网络安全及CBRN领域风险控制，引入可控框架，在处理高风险请求时会主动暂停并寻求人工确认。此次更新标志着Gemini从对话助手向主动执行的“电脑管家”转型，旨在通过自动化办公与工具调用，最大限度减少人工参与，加速AI直接操控数字</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布iOS 27系统更新，Siri引入独立应用并支持切换至ChatGPT</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6813df2e9665452570de95e6957dbdab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果在iOS 27系统中对Siri进行架构升级，推出全新的独立Siri应用。该应用采用聊天机器人设计，支持文本输入、图片与文档上传，并保留对话历史。在模型集成方面，苹果采取开放策略，用户长按对话输入框点击“Ask…”按钮，即可在系统默认的Siri AI与ChatGPT之间自由切换。目前该功能处于初期迭代阶段，存在一定的保护机制：应用重启后会自动重置为默认的Siri AI模式，且系统设置中暂不支持将ChatGPT设为永久默认模型。此次更新标志着苹果在保持生态安全的同时，通过引入外部主流模型提升AI交互的生产力，未来有望接入更多元化的AI模型以丰富用户选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度整合升级文心网站并加持文心5.1模型，新增Office在线编辑功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4a6bea6d5463238eab3ac136b1ca3aef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月25日，百度正式将旗下分散的AI服务入口统一整合为全新的“百度文心网站”。此次升级核心在于全面接入文心5.1大模型，通过更强大的技术底座提升交互效率。在功能矩阵方面，新网站在保留智能文字创作、图片创作、AI阅读及智能体应用的基础上，重磅上线了Office文档在线编辑功能，全面支持PPT、Excel和Word的在线处理，并新增定时任务等效率工具。针对特定场景，网站还推出了AI志愿报告、一键生成AI PPT、基于文心5.1深度搜索的深入研究及AI音乐创作等功能。此次整合旨在打造一站式AI服务超级入口，覆盖学习、办公、生活及娱乐全场景。这一动作标志着百度AI原生应用正加速向生态聚合阶段迈进，通过统一入口降低用户使用门槛，推动大模型技术在日常工作与生活中的深度渗透。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合博通发布首款自研AI推理芯片Jalapeño，计划2026年底部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d7c9b66cdadb43eb0acbfe4eba475f7c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式与博通联合发布首款定制化AI推理芯片Jalapeño，标志着其从软件算法向底层硬件架构设计的深度延伸。该芯片专为LLM推理任务打造，采用ASIC架构，从设计到流片仅耗时9个月，期间利用OpenAI自研模型加速设计流程。在分工上，OpenAI负责核心架构，博通负责硅片实现与网络硬件支持，Celestica负责板卡与机架集成。早期测试显示，Jalapeño在运行GPT-5.3、Codex及Spark等任务时，展现出卓越的每瓦性能与计算资源利用率。OpenAI总裁格雷格·布罗克曼表示，此举是构建全栈基础设施的关键，旨在降低运营成本并提升智能驱动效率。Jalapeño作为OpenAI多代计算平台首块拼图，计划于2026年底前完成首次部署。此举不仅是OpenAI摆脱单一算力依赖、应对推理算力激增的战略选择</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GitHub Copilot于6月正式启用量化计费模式，单月使用量创历史新高</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e642665c6fa69d5325155f0e6be424f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">GitHub于6月1日正式将AI编程工具GitHub Copilot的收费模式由固定统一定价调整为按使用量计费。GitHub技术长弗拉基米尔·费多罗夫证实，该调整直接推动了客户使用量大幅激增，使6月成为平台上线以来表现最好的月份。尽管用量爆发，GitHub目前暂无调涨价格的计划。此次计费模式变更旨在应对Cursor、OpenAI Codex及Anthropic Claude Code等原生AI编程工具带来的激烈市场竞争。然而，用量激增也对基础设施造成显著压力，GitHub在2026年已遭遇数十次重大停机，微软目前正寻求通过与亚马逊合作以解决容量限制问题。此次事件标志着AI编程工具市场已进入商业模式与基础设施能力双重竞争的深水区。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
